      "end_timestamp": "00:27",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "medications[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "She is on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day, I give it to her. Actually, she is on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count, I give it to her. She takes metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for the heart rhythm. She takes face wash, twice a day.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:28",
      "end_timestamp": "00:51",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]",
        "medications[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Alright, can you tell me when it first started?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:55",
      "end_timestamp": "00:58",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Around nearly five years... no wait, it's more like two years.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:59",
      "end_timestamp": "01:05",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Actually, I was getting to that! There's spots on my face as well. Okay, so I've been feeling low about my skin too.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:23",
      "end_timestamp": "01:36",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]",
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Is it a lot or only a little?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:37",
      "end_timestamp": "01:41",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—",
      "start_timestamp": "01:42",
      "end_timestamp": "01:49",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:50",
      "end_timestamp": "01:55",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'd say severe.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:58",
      "end_timestamp": "02:00",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "speaker_role": "unknown",
